                    "content": "I've secured your hotel and gathered the restaurant information for your trip to Paris from May 10th to May 13th.\n\n### Hotel Recommendation:\n**Hotel Name:** Montmartre Suites  \n**Rating:** 4.7  \n**Reviews:** Luxurious suites with stunning views of Montmartre. Impeccable cleanliness and attention to detail. The staff went above and beyond to make your stay memorable. Perfect location for exploring the charming Montmartre neighborhood.\n\n### Restaurant Recommendation:\n**Restaurant Name:** Le Baratin  \n**Cuisine:** French  \n**Rating:** 4.8  \n**Reviews:** A small, cozy bistro with delicious, homestyle cooking. Daily changing menu based on fresh market ingredients. Natural wine selection. (Cash only)\n\n### Cost Estimate for Your Trip:\n1. **Hotel Cost:** \n   - Rate: Approximately $200 per day\n   - Total for 3 days: $600\n\n2. **Restaurant Costs:** \n   - Lunch (2 people) at Le Baratin: $30 per person\n   - Dinner (2 people) at Le Baratin: $30 per person\n   - Total per day for lunch and dinner: $120 \n   - Total for 3 days: $360\n\n### Total Estimated Cost:\n- **Hotel:** $600\n- **Meals:** $360\n- **Total:** **$960**\n\nIf you have any further questions or need additional arrangements, feel free to ask!"
